1
00:01:38,637 --> 00:01:42,803
只有我父亲才会跟若无其事地将恶意兼并办成公关举动
Only my father would turn a hostile takeover into a fluffy PR move.

2
00:01:43,470 --> 00:01:46,762
在新闻里 他说他只是想吃个饭然后谈点事情
On the news, he said he just wanted to break bread and hash things out.

3
00:01:47,137 --> 00:01:48,512
也许也不会很糟吧
Maybe it won't be so bad.

4
00:01:48,762 --> 00:01:51,845
我们确实希望将军能够和这帮人好好聊聊 不是吗?
We do want the General to start opening up to these people, right?

5
00:01:52,178 --> 00:01:53,762
没错 但是和平沟通的前提是双方对等
Yeah, but on his terms.

6
00:01:53,970 --> 00:01:55,637
但是这晚宴可是对方举办的
Ironwood's going to be locked in a room

7
00:01:55,678 --> 00:01:57,220
一旦参加埃隆伍德就等于深入敌营
at his rival's own dinner party.

8
00:01:57,553 --> 00:01:59,345
我知道杰克说他乐意变得温和些
I know Jacques says he's happy to moderate,

9
00:01:59,470 --> 00:02:02,720
但他真正的意思是 他会变成控制对话的人
but all that really means is he'll be the one controlling the conversation.

10
00:02:03,095 --> 00:02:04,970
不难想象接下来会怎么发展
Not hard to imagine how that's gonna play out.

11
00:02:05,262 --> 00:02:06,970
我还是不敢相信他赢了
I still can't believe he won.

12
00:02:07,845 --> 00:02:10,803
罗宾才应该是人们的捍卫者 不是吗?
Robyn was supposed to be the people's champion, wasn't she?

13
00:02:12,512 --> 00:02:14,678
这里有太多巧合了
There's just too many coincidences.

14
00:02:15,012 --> 00:02:17,595
你真的认为你爸和塞伦有关系吗?
You really think your dad might have something to do with Salem?

15
00:02:19,845 --> 00:02:22,303
我觉得我父亲会不惜一切代价来取胜
I think my father would do whatever it takes to win.

16
00:02:22,678 --> 00:02:23,928
那我们也应该这么做
And we should do the same.

17
00:02:24,553 --> 00:02:25,428
你是指...?
Meaning...?

18
00:02:25,970 --> 00:02:28,178
没人能比你更了解你爸
Well, no one knows your dad better than you,

19
00:02:28,428 --> 00:02:29,720
在今晚的赴宴者中
and out of everyone going tonight,

20
00:02:29,762 --> 00:02:31,345
我觉得你是唯一能够
I'd say you're the only one who could snoop

21
00:02:31,387 --> 00:02:32,970
在会场打探信息时不被问话的人
around the house and not be questioned.

22
00:02:33,803 --> 00:02:35,970
如果杰克·雪倪真的有牵涉到什么事情的话
If Jacques Schnee is up to something,

23
00:02:36,595 --> 00:02:38,303
我觉得我们应该有所了解
I think we should know what it is.

24
00:03:01,137 --> 00:03:02,678
或许我们该在镜头前微笑?
Suppose we should smile for the cameras?

25
00:03:03,053 --> 00:03:05,262
恕我直言，将军，要我笑你可是要付钱的
Sir, with all due respect, you'd have to pay me.

26
00:03:17,803 --> 00:03:19,178
晚上好 各位
Good evening, everyone.

27
00:03:19,970 --> 00:03:21,053
Klein在哪儿？
Where's Klein?

28
00:03:22,012 --> 00:03:23,803
你这和你亲爱的弟弟寒暄的方式
What an interesting way to say,

29
00:03:23,928 --> 00:03:26,428
可真有创意
"Hello, dear brother, how have you been?"

30
00:03:27,887 --> 00:03:29,387
恐怕你在这里找不到他
I'm afraid you won't find him here.

31
00:03:29,762 --> 00:03:32,512
他被开除了 我是想不出为什么
He was let go. I can't imagine why.

32
00:03:35,053 --> 00:03:38,720
将军 您到底认为我们的餐桌有多大?
General, exactly how large do you think our dining room table is?

33
00:03:39,262 --> 00:03:40,887
我刚好知道 桌子非常巨大
I happen to know it's enormous,

34
00:03:41,137 --> 00:03:42,887
但是大多数人会在这儿待命
but most of my guests will be on standby

35
00:03:42,928 --> 00:03:45,095
以防议会需要更多的见证人
in case the Council requests additional eye witnesses.

36
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:48,970
除此以外 我可以肯定他们会愉悦地庆祝你父亲的胜利
Until then, I'm sure they'll be happily celebrating your father's victory.

37
00:04:02,262 --> 00:04:05,345
那些要和我们一起用餐的 请随我来
For those of you joining us in the dining room, please follow me.

38
00:04:07,512 --> 00:04:08,428
祝我们好运
Wish us luck.

39
00:04:09,637 --> 00:04:11,637
他们既然都已经邀请你了 不是吗
I mean, they already invited you, didn't they?

40
00:04:17,428 --> 00:04:18,637
要喝一杯吗 先生?
Care for a drink, sir?

41
00:04:19,637 --> 00:04:21,803
呃 不用了 谢谢
Uh, no, no thanks.

42
00:04:22,512 --> 00:04:24,595
我觉得我该去巡逻了
I think I'll just stick to patrolling the grounds.

43
00:04:28,012 --> 00:04:29,470
他抢了我的话
Words out of my mouth.

44
00:04:30,262 --> 00:04:33,262
好吧 别乱逛 别惹事
Right, well, don't wander off, don't break anything,

45
00:04:33,303 --> 00:04:35,262
记得要做好将军找你们的准备
and be ready in case the General calls on you.

46
00:04:37,137 --> 00:04:37,845
吃点开胃菜?
Hors d'oeuvres?

47
00:04:37,887 --> 00:04:39,845
我们去房子外面吃吧
Let's eat them out of house and home.

48
00:04:41,095 --> 00:04:44,720
相反 我们不如出去转转 考虑搞点破坏
Counterpoint, how about we do wander off, consider breaking things,

49
00:04:44,762 --> 00:04:45,887
然后再做点别的
and then all that other stuff.

50
00:04:46,428 --> 00:04:47,345
我会保持联系的
I'll be in touch.

51
00:04:50,053 --> 00:04:54,512
亲爱的姐姐 我希望我们能够用这些时间来叙叙旧
Dear sister, I was hoping we could use this time to catch up.

52
00:04:57,053 --> 00:04:59,970
我得知道 你为什么当初历经艰难离家出走
I have to know, why did you go through so much trouble

53
00:05:00,012 --> 00:05:02,553
只为现在爬着回家?
to leave home, only to come crawling back?

54
00:05:06,012 --> 00:05:07,387
这情况可能是个问题
This might be a problem.

55
00:05:08,137 --> 00:05:14,470
埃隆伍德将军 请坐
General Ironwood, please, have a seat.

56
00:05:20,262 --> 00:05:23,262
Sleet议员 Camilla议员
Councilman Sleet, Councilwoman Camilla.

57
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:26,512
修议员听起来也不错
Councilwoman Hill would have had a nice ring to it.

58
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:30,595
尽管我能受邀来这里我已经很感激了
Though I suppose I should just be grateful I got invited to the table.

59
00:05:32,053 --> 00:05:35,970
修小姐 你的热情正是
Miss Hill, that vigor of yours is precisely

60
00:05:36,012 --> 00:05:38,470
我们感谢您今晚与我们同在的原因
why we're grateful to have you with us tonight.

61
00:05:41,137 --> 00:05:42,637
她在这里干什么？
What is she doing here?

62
00:05:42,970 --> 00:05:45,220
我们在这里干什么 詹姆斯
What we're all doing here, James,

63
00:05:45,428 --> 00:05:47,887
为了解决我们王国的问题
addressing the concerns of our kingdom,

64
00:05:48,553 --> 00:05:51,970
意味着我们有很多东西需要讨论
which means we have much to discuss.

65
00:05:52,220 --> 00:05:54,720
确实，我希望我们可以从...
Indeed. I was hoping we could start by --

66
00:05:54,762 --> 00:05:56,928
顺便 有她在这里我们安全吗?
Are we safe with her here, by the way?

67
00:05:57,762 --> 00:06:03,595
我仍记得一些有关她经历那场大屠杀的风言风语
I do recall some confusion regarding her involvement in that horrific massacre.

68
00:06:04,303 --> 00:06:07,970
就如官方报告所述 那段视频是伪造的
As the official report stated, that footage was doctored.

69
00:06:08,012 --> 00:06:10,303
Penny完全在我的控制之中
Penny is completely under my control.

70
00:06:10,887 --> 00:06:12,845
这可太令人担心了
Which is concerning, I think.

71
00:06:14,053 --> 00:06:15,178
担心?
Concerning?

72
00:06:16,012 --> 00:06:19,970
那让我们聊聊你到底控制了些什么
Let's talk about exactly what it is you control.

73
00:06:24,387 --> 00:06:26,137
那小鬼怎么还不走?
Why won't this kid buzz off?

74
00:06:26,345 --> 00:06:27,303
我们要做些什么
We need to do something.

75
00:06:27,970 --> 00:06:30,470
我们之前不是说过搞破坏来着?
What was that earlier about breaking things?

76
00:06:35,887 --> 00:06:38,595
惠特利 我觉得公司有你这样的人真是幸运
Well, Whitley, I'm sure the company is lucky to have you,

77
00:06:38,970 --> 00:06:39,970
如果你不介意的话...
but if you'll pardon me--

78
00:06:40,012 --> 00:06:41,762
所以你到底要去哪里?
And where exactly is it that you're going?

79
00:06:42,428 --> 00:06:45,762
小心一大堆吃的过来啦!
Careful, messy food comin' through!

80
00:06:45,803 --> 00:06:48,803
公司说会给我安排私人停车位
the company has promised me my own parking space,

81
00:06:50,012 --> 00:06:51,053
请问要来点喝的吗?
[Butler] Care for a drink?

82
00:06:51,095 --> 00:06:51,970
当然!
Don't mind if I do!

83
00:06:54,428 --> 00:06:55,803
呀 不好啦 小心!
[Nora] Oh no, look out!

84
00:06:56,012 --> 00:06:57,720
我要去拿点餐前小点了
I'm going to go get some hors d'oeuvres.

85
00:07:26,595 --> 00:07:27,970
抱歉 失陪了
If you'll excuse me.

86
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,012
现在的情况是
The fact of the matter is

87
00:07:40,053 --> 00:07:43,887
James你在过去几年间一直都是实行自治
you've operated with a fair amount of autonomy for the past few years, James.

88
00:07:43,928 --> 00:07:45,595
现在我们需要你做的是
But what we need now is for you

89
00:07:45,637 --> 00:07:46,845
跟我们合作
to work with us.

90
00:07:46,887 --> 00:07:48,178
长官 我
[Ironwood] Sir, I have--

91
00:07:48,220 --> 00:07:51,970
很明显 没有任何王国想要与擎天发起战争
It's obvious that no kingdom intends to declare war on Atlas.

92
00:07:52,387 --> 00:07:55,012
我们与避风港事件并无关联
We had no involvement in the incident at Haven,

93
00:07:55,053 --> 00:07:58,012
我们也有信标陷落时我们的无人机并不受我们的控制的证据
we have proof our drones weren't acting on orders at Beacon.

94
00:07:58,137 --> 00:08:00,470
在现在的情况下 关闭擎天边境
At this point, the closure of Atlas borders

95
00:08:00,512 --> 00:08:03,887
只会让我们跟其他地区的关系受损
is only serving to hurt our relations with the rest of the world.

96
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,053
我
I--

97
00:08:05,137 --> 00:08:06,470
其他地区?
The rest of the world?

98
00:08:06,678 --> 00:08:08,012
受伤的是我们
It's hurting us.

99
00:08:08,470 --> 00:08:10,553
擎天的人民非常痛苦
The people of Atlas are suffering

100
00:08:10,595 --> 00:08:12,553
而他们想知道为什么
and they want to know why.

101
00:08:13,637 --> 00:08:15,428
你说的没错 Hill小姐
[Jacques] Quite right, Ms. Hill.

102
00:08:16,678 --> 00:08:22,137
近期带给我们的民众伤害的 恐怕不只是你的选择
And I'm afraid there's more than just your choices that have brought harm to our citizens as of late.

103
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:25,637
有关曼特城屠杀市民一事
Have your forces found any additional evidence

104
00:08:25,678 --> 00:08:29,595
你的下属有找到新的线索么?
as to who is slaughtering innocent civilians down in Mantle?

105
00:08:29,928 --> 00:08:32,012
那件事目前正在调查之中
That is an ongoing investigation,

106
00:08:32,262 --> 00:08:34,595
很抱歉 正在进行的调查属于机密事项 相关信息不能透露
the details of which are classified, I'm afraid.

107
00:08:34,637 --> 00:08:39,512
我怕的正是你越来越多的所谓机密事项
[Jacques] I'm afraid of the ever-growing list of classified information you seem to be keeping.

108
00:08:39,595 --> 00:08:41,345
我问了问其他的议员
I asked our fellow councilmen here

109
00:08:41,387 --> 00:08:44,220
希望他们能告诉我更多关于阿米蒂计划的细节
to shed some light on your Amity Colosseum project

110
00:08:44,262 --> 00:08:47,803
而事实却是 他们知道的不比我多
and, as it turns out, they know about as much as I do.

111
00:08:47,845 --> 00:08:49,387
连你都不知道?
Even you don't know?

112
00:08:49,428 --> 00:08:52,387
阿米蒂计划会解决你所提出的一切问题
[Ironwood] The Amity project will help with all of the issues you've presented,

113
00:08:52,887 --> 00:08:56,220
但你需要理解 目前它依然是最高机密
but you have to understand that discretion is a top priority at this time.

114
00:08:56,262 --> 00:08:58,220
你是在说你不信任我们吗?
[Jacques] Are you saying you don't trust us?

115
00:08:58,262 --> 00:09:00,720
你不能像收买其他东西一样收买他人的信任
You can't just buy trust like everything else,

116
00:09:00,928 --> 00:09:02,387
信任是争取来的
you have to earn it.

117
00:09:06,970 --> 00:09:09,803
你说的没错
I couldn't have said it better myself.

118
00:09:12,012 --> 00:09:17,803
将军 恕我直言 你已经将议会对你最后剩余的信任都消磨殆尽
General, if I may be blunt, you have spent what little trust this council had left in you.

119
00:09:18,178 --> 00:09:21,803
黑进擎天无人机系统的人还未被抓获
The hacker who turned Atlas drones against us was never captured,

120
00:09:22,095 --> 00:09:24,845
谋杀反对你的批评家的凶手依然逍遥法外
whoever's been murdering your critics is still at large.

121
00:09:24,970 --> 00:09:29,637
近期这种情况 要让我们如何信任你呢?
How are we supposed to give you our trust, when you've given us nothing as of late?

122
00:09:29,678 --> 00:09:30,470
那并不是
That's not what--

123
00:09:30,553 --> 00:09:30,720
Winter
Winter.

124
00:09:32,303 --> 00:09:33,095
够了
That's enough.

125
00:09:36,262 --> 00:09:37,053
抱歉
[Winter] Excuse me.

126
00:09:53,553 --> 00:09:55,928
小姐 有什么事吗?
Miss Schnee, is everything okay?

127
00:09:55,970 --> 00:09:57,345
没事我很好 谢谢
I'm fine, thank you!

128
00:09:57,387 --> 00:09:58,345
继续努力
Keep up the great work.

129
00:10:11,012 --> 00:10:12,678
你好 亲爱的
[Willow] Hello darling.

130
00:10:18,803 --> 00:10:19,970
你还好吗?
[Penny] Are you okay?

131
00:10:23,387 --> 00:10:26,595
没什么大不了 我只是没控制好自己的情绪
I'll be fine, I just let my emotions get the better of me.

132
00:10:27,345 --> 00:10:28,303
那是什么意思?
What do you mean?

133
00:10:29,137 --> 00:10:30,095
你不会理解的
You wouldn't understand.

134
00:10:31,887 --> 00:10:34,887
哦 也是
Oh, right.

135
00:10:35,887 --> 00:10:42,470
不，不是那个意思，我是说，这里，特别是对于我来说，有着许多回忆。
No, no, what I mean is: this place holds a lot of memories for me, specifically.

136
00:10:42,803 --> 00:10:46,220
我本以为我控制得很好 但你也听到我刚才的话了
I thought I was in control, but you heard me.

137
00:10:46,637 --> 00:10:48,637
我听起来像个暴躁的孩子
I sounded like a petulant child.

138
00:10:48,928 --> 00:10:50,387
我觉得没什么问题
I thought you sounded fine.

139
00:10:50,595 --> 00:10:52,303
你只是说了真心话
You were just speaking from your heart.

140
00:10:52,678 --> 00:10:54,512
而那恰好就是问题所在
And that is precisely the problem.

141
00:10:54,845 --> 00:10:56,303
我应该安分守己就好的
I should have just stayed in line.

142
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,928
我觉得你是对的
I guess you're right,

143
00:11:00,387 --> 00:11:01,595
我是理解不了
I don't understand.

144
00:11:10,178 --> 00:11:12,678
抱歉我没能下楼去看看你的派对
I'm sorry I couldn't come down for your party,

145
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:15,637
我只是有些不舒服
I'm afraid I'm not feeling well.

146
00:11:18,178 --> 00:11:22,178
呃 没事的 妈妈 没关系
Um, it's okay, Mom, it's fine.

147
00:11:26,928 --> 00:11:30,720
你在你父亲的办公室做什么?
What are you doing in your father's office?

148
00:11:32,512 --> 00:11:33,845
只是来找找我忘在这儿的东西
Just looking for something I left.

149
00:11:36,928 --> 00:11:39,262
哦对 你出走了
That's right, you left.

150
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:42,720
离家出走
You left.

151
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:48,012
我需要用父亲的电脑
I need to use father's computer.

152
00:11:49,137 --> 00:11:49,845
为什么?
Why?

153
00:11:50,053 --> 00:11:55,137
因为我认为他做了些事 一些不好的事
Because I think he may have done something. Something wrong.

154
00:11:55,387 --> 00:11:58,012
我以为大家都已经默认他肯定做了坏事
I thought we all simply assumed that at this point.

155
00:11:58,178 --> 00:12:00,637
是的 这些人之中有一部分想对此做些什么
Yes, well, some of us are trying to do something about it.

156
00:12:14,137 --> 00:12:15,970
他家里这台电脑上了锁
He started locking his home computer.

157
00:12:18,512 --> 00:12:22,428
但 他仍有盲区
But, he still has blind spots.

158
00:12:29,595 --> 00:12:31,137
你在这儿装了监控?
You put a camera in here?

159
00:12:31,387 --> 00:12:33,428
我在家里每个房间都装了
I put them in every room of this house,

160
00:12:34,012 --> 00:12:36,345
是为了我们的安全 万一我需要...
for our safety, in case I ever needed to...

161
00:12:40,095 --> 00:12:42,262
你回来不是为了留下来对吗？
You haven't come back to stay, have you?

162
00:12:43,970 --> 00:12:44,595
对 不是
No.

163
00:12:46,887 --> 00:12:47,637
那就好
Good.

164
00:12:56,512 --> 00:12:58,887
之前有个男人来过
(sniffling) A man came by.

165
00:13:00,387 --> 00:13:05,012
你父亲恐怕被卷入了比他想象中更加危险的事了
I'm afraid your father may be involved in something more dangerous than he realizes.

166
00:13:10,553 --> 00:13:12,345
无论发生什么 Weiss
[Willow] No matter what happens, Weiss,

167
00:13:14,012 --> 00:13:15,470
一定不要忘记你弟弟
please don't forget about your brother.

168
00:13:16,803 --> 00:13:18,553
Whitley根本不想跟我有任何交集
